   "q": "<p>Burak is a wingsuit flyer. He is a guest on a TV programme today.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 150\" width=\"500\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Adventure Talk TV röportajı\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"480\" height=\"122\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"18\" width=\"456\" height=\"102\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"24\" width=\"140\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Adventure Talk TV</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"108\" width=\"380\" height=\"8\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#94a3b8\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"70\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"65\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#2563eb\" opacity=\"0.85\"/><path d=\"M117,85 q13,-14 26,0\" fill=\"#2563eb\" opacity=\"0.85\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#2563eb\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Selin (host)</text><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"70\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#f3e8ff\" stroke=\"#9333ea\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"65\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#9333ea\" opacity=\"0.85\"/><path d=\"M357,85 q13,-14 26,0\" fill=\"#9333ea\" opacity=\"0.85\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#9333ea\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Burak</text><rect x=\"230\" y=\"130\" width=\"40\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"138\" width=\"120\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/></svg></div>\n<p><b>Selin:</b> Welcome, Burak! Which extreme sport are you into?<br><b>Burak:</b> Wingsuit flying. I jump from high mountains and fly like a bird.<br><b>Selin:</b> ----?<br><b>Burak:</b> Three or four times a month, if the weather is good.<br><b>Selin:</b> ----?<br><b>Burak:</b> Not at all! I trust my training and my equipment.<br><b>Selin:</b> ----?<br><b>Burak:</b> Because nothing is more thrilling than flying 200 km/h over the valleys.</p>\n<p>Which of the following questions does Selin <b>NOT</b> ask Burak?</p>",
   "c": [
    "Why do you like it so much",
    "What do you need for it",
    "How often do you fly",
    "Do you feel scared during a flight"
   ],
   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Selin’in üç sorusu boş (----); Burak’ın cevapları verilmiş.</li> <li>Cevaplar: «Three or four times a month», «Not at all! I trust my training…», «Because nothing is more thrilling…»</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Selin’in <b>sormadığı</b> (NOT) soru.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Soru–cevap eşleştirme yap</b> Boş soruyu, hemen altındaki cevabın türünden buluruz: sıklık cevabı → How often, evet/hayır cevabı → Do you…, Because → Why.</li> <li><b>Cevapları tek tek oku</b> «Three or four times a month» = ayda üç dört kez → sıklık sorusu. «Not at all! I trust my training» = Hiç de değil! Eğitimime güveniyorum → korku sorusu. «Because nothing is more thrilling…» = Çünkü hiçbir şey daha heyecan verici değil → sebep sorusu.</li> <li><b>Eşleşmeyeni bul</b> Burak hiçbir cevabında ekipman (wingsuit, parachute vb.) listelemiyor; «What do you need for it?» (Bunun için neye ihtiyacın var?) sorusunun cevabı yok.</li></ol><table class=\"sv-c\"><tr><td>A</td><td>«Because…» cevabı → «Why do you like it so much?» sorulmuş.</td></tr><tr class=\"ok\"><td>B</td><td>Hiçbir cevap ihtiyaç duyulan ekipmanı saymıyor → bu soru sorulmamış.</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>«Three or four times a month» → «How often do you fly?» sorulmuş.</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>«Not at all!» → «Do you feel scared during a flight?» sorulmuş.</td></tr></table><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> How often → sıklık zarfı (once a week, three times a month); Why → Because; Do/Does → Yes/No ya da «Not at all».</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> «I trust my … equipment» cümlesinde «equipment» kelimesini görüp B’yi sorulmuş sanma; bu cümle korkuya verilen cevaptır, ekipman listesi değildir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
