   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Read Asya’s diary entry.</p><div class=\"box\">“My dad had promised me a hang gliding flight for my fifteenth birthday, and I had been looking forward to it for months. But on the morning of the flight, I could hardly eat my breakfast. My hands were cold and wet. In the air, everything changed: the pilot let me hold the bar for a whole minute, and I felt like a bird! When we landed, Dad hugged me and said I was much braver than him. He had refused to fly with the other pilot.”</div><p>I. Asya was nervous before the flight.<br>II. Asya flew the hang glider alone.<br>III. Asya’s father did not fly that day.</p><p>Which of the statements above can be inferred from the text?</p>",
