   "q": "<p>The table shows the number of members of a climbing gym. The manager wrote a report about it.</p><table><tr><th>Age group</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>under 12</td><td>40</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>12–17</td><td>80</td><td>120</td></tr><tr><td>18 and over</td><td>150</td><td>150</td></tr></table><p>Which sentence in the manager’s report is <b>NOT</b> correct?</p>",
